ife on the Peninsula", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 3, "type": "position"}, {"content": "scholar > Celebrating Important Occasions > Day of the Dead", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 12, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.1", "type": "level"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about travel and vacations in social situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Talking About Daily Routines", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Daily routines are things you do every day.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "When you talk about daily routines, you use the Present tense and a preposition of time like <span class=\"strong\">at, until, by</span> and <span class=\"strong\">from \u2026 to</span>.  <br/><br/>You use expressions of time like <span class=\"strong\">On Saturdays ...</span> to say that you do things on a regular basis.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Preposition or<br/> Expression of Time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Use\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"at\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I wake up at 7:00 a.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"until\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"a period of time leading up to a specific time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm in class until 3:00 in the afternoon. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"in or during a period of time\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I read the newspaper in the morning.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"from ... to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"the beginning and ending time of an activity\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I have classes from 9:00 to 3:00 every day.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on (Sundays) ...\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"on the same day of the week  \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I don't work on Sundays.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Should, Could, Have to, Must", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Should, could, might, have to and must are modals. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " I should go to the gym for an hour after work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">should, could</span> and <span class=\"italic\">might</span> to give advice, show possibility or expectation, or make a suggestion.  <br/>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "You use <span class=\"italic\">have to</span> and <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to show necessity. <br/>The modals are followed by a verb in the base form. The verb does not change.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I could go for a jog before work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "I must wake up early. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Sometimes I have to buy ingredients or research new recipes in the afternoon. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "routine ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a series of things you do in a similar way each time", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you have a routine on the cruise ship?", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when you talk about daily routines.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "activity ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "something that someone does; an interest", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I like to do activities when we're at port.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "hour ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "60 minutes", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I should go to the gym for an hour after work.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "to wake up ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to stop sleeping", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I must wake up early to get to class in time.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "morning", "type": "name"}, {"content": "time of the day from around 5:00 a.m to 12:00 p.m.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I get up around 8:00 and have a light breakfast in the morning. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "afternoon ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "time of the day from around 12:00 - 6:00 p.m.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Sometimes I have to buy ingredients or look up new recipes in the afternoon.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "port ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the place where a cruise ship stops", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I sometimes do activities when we're at port. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn4le12ob03aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Work with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Choose a famous person your partner may know. Don't tell your partner who it is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Invent a daily routine for this person. The routines can be funny and creative. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Write 5 sentences, like <span class=\"italic\">\"In the morning, I ... \"</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Put clues into the daily routine to help your partner guess who it is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Ask your partner to guess who it is.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Change roles and repeat.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "I write about daily routines.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I use expressions of time.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I make predictions.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}